{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213420","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521342001:0":{"text":"Are we really pulling out of Mirehold soon? That can't be true, right?","source_cn":"这两天就要从水泽营地撤走？不是真的吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60045ED8E4CF2EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521342002:0":{"text":"Why? You planning to stay?","source_cn":"怎么，你还想留在这里不成？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5A5378FA41C4A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521342003:0":{"text":"Kinda. We've been stationed here so long it's hard not to feel attached.","source_cn":"是啊。在这驻扎了这么久，多少都有点舍不得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76A1F9ECFC314BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521342004:0":{"text":"And now that the war is over, I actually wanted to make a few Wildborn friends.","source_cn":"而且战争好不容易才结束，我还想多交几个兽人朋友呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x501C600F2BFF4F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521342005:0":{"text":"You want to be friends with the Wildborn? Are you out of your mind?","source_cn":"和兽人交朋友？你脑子出问题了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF5305021996D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521342006:0":{"text":"Oh, come on, some of them are kind of cute! Animal ears, tails... maybe even fluffy little paws!","source_cn":"你不觉得有些兽人长得很可爱吗？有动物一样的耳朵和尾巴，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C7D8BB35887A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521342007:0":{"text":"I wonder if their fur is softer than my dog's.","source_cn":"不知道他们的毛摸起来会不会比我家狗的更光滑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F61604EB4FC605E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521342008:0":{"text":"Say, could you ever picture yourself falling in love with a Wildborn?","source_cn":"那么，你会爱上雅库伯尔人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA78A8CF8C39A46E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521342009:0":{"text":"Whoa, a cute Wildborn girl?","source_cn":"哇哦，一个可爱的兽人小姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25906A7D542A91D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521342010:0":{"text":"Hmm... to be honest, it wouldn't be so bad. The Wildborn girls are strong. We could go hunting together.","source_cn":"让我想想……爱上兽人应该也没什么不好的吧。雅库伯尔的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08EF02A7323BD68B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521342011:0":{"text":"Now that sounds way more fun than standing guard all day!","source_cn":"哎呀，打猎……打猎肯定比在军队里值班有意思多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x230FC8C08C750061","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521342012:0":{"text":"... You're absolutely insane!","source_cn":"……你真是彻底疯了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32EC2BE9FBFDD6A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿瑞":{"text":"Ari","source":"阿瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吕科墨":{"text":"Lukam","source":"吕科墨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}